      "id": 171377,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-03T23:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Intentional.</p><p>All of Chrono's Bounties say to destroy the bounty when the target dies except \"The Ultimate Target\", that's why his Hat can destroy them.</p><p>So the answer is \"it depend on the card text\" as you rightly guessed.</p>",
