      "raw": "<p>Playing the cardboard game, my intuition always told me that if there wasn&#39;t a target next to an attachable card, it ought to go away. But with TUT, it&#39;s actually useful to keep it in play; if it&#39;s your only bounty, you can still get use out of the Masadah and Danny Boy, if DR is an issue. Granted, it still seems like a weird thing, but that&#39;s the only reason I can see for it staying in play. (Unless we want to get into discussions of it being his &quot;best&quot; bounty.)</p>",
