      "id": 171379,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-04T00:27:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When they bring WotC to the video game, you'll see that Sky-Scraper's links stick around after their assigned targets are destroyed. &nbsp;This comes in handy for having a bunch of extra links in play for Explosive Reveal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's also slightly relevant for Expatriette, in that ammo can be left behind if the gun it's attached to is destroyed. &nbsp;But there are exactly zero cases in the game where you would want to destroy a gun before destroying its ammo, so this rarely comes up.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:54:04.195Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
