      "created_at": "2016-04-04T00:28:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A similar case can occur if a gun is destroyed with ammo attached. &nbsp; The ammo stays in Expat's play area not doing anything. &nbsp;Sky-Scraper also has Link cards which stay in play even if the target it's attached to leaves play.&nbsp;</p>",
